## Title: AHledger
## Notes: Auction house prices in your tooltips and crafting windows, a ledger bar with your bags, session gold, alerts and deals, the best quest reward marked, vendor flips, a watchlist with alerts, and a scanner that contributes to a shared price database for World of Warcraft: Forever. Free, no automation, nothing paywalled.
